Dialogue: 1,0:02:13.47,0:02:17.39,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c&HE52913&\1c&HFFBF97&}等待著雨後的天空
Dialogue: 1,0:02:17.43,0:02:23.27,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c&HE52913&\1c&HFFBF97&}我將這片寂靜撕裂
Dialogue: 1,0:02:33.24,0:02:37.99,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c&HE52913&\1c&HFFBF97&}在那不斷前進的日子裡
Dialogue: 1,0:02:38.12,0:02:42.91,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c&HE52913&\1c&HFFBF97&}腦海中不斷浮現出那個特別之人
Dialogue: 1,0:02:43.00,0:02:47.79,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c&HE52913&\1c&HFFBF97&}保護著凍僵的你的
Dialogue: 1,0:02:47.92,0:02:52.84,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c&HE52913&\1c&HFFBF97&}是與他所構築的種種回憶
Dialogue: 1,0:02:52.88,0:02:57.68,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c&HE52913&\1c&HFFBF97&}在這小小的手掌之中
Dialogue: 1,0:02:57.80,0:03:02.77,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c&HE52913&\1c&HFFBF97&}我要緊緊地  緊緊地  緊緊地
Dialogue: 1,0:03:03.02,0:03:06.69,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c&HE52913&\1c&HFFBF97&}將未來抓住
Dialogue: 1,0:03:07.56,0:03:11.44,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c&HE52913&\1c&HFFBF97&}看啊  雨後的天空
Dialogue: 1,0:03:11.61,0:03:13.98,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c&HE52913&\1c&HFFBF97&}架起了一道彩虹
Dialogue: 1,0:03:14.03,0:03:17.45,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c&HE52913&\1c&HFFBF97&}這樣的日子一定會來到
Dialogue: 1,0:03:17.53,0:03:21.37,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c&HE52913&\1c&HFFBF97&}現在跪倒不起的你也會如同那天空
Dialogue: 1,0:03:21.45,0:03:23.54,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c&HE52913&\1c&HFFBF97&}無論多少次
Dialogue: 1,0:03:23.62,0:03:27.46,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c&HE52913&\1c&HFFBF97&}都一定能綻放出光彩
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.47,0:02:17.39,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3cFFFFFF\bord3\blur2.5\1aFF}等待著雨後的天空
